Prometheus, the Titan~
Prometheus, the Titan, deals with his eternal faith here.
~
     Prometheus was once a great titan who had helped his brothers
in the conquest to destroy Mt. Olympus.  He was one of the few
that was able to sneak past the guards and steal one of the god's
treasures.  He had given fire to men, which he had stole from
Zues, and was now paying for his thievery on this canyon wall.
Blood trickles down is back from the wound Zeus's eagle has 
created, by picking at the titan's liver.
~
